# basic-pitch ONNX model
#
# The model file (basic-pitch-nmp.onnx, ~225KB) is excluded from git.
# To obtain it, run one of:
#
#   cp ~/audio-tools-venv/lib/python3.13/site-packages/basic_pitch/saved_models/icassp_2022/nmp.onnx \
#      packages/music/models/basic-pitch-nmp.onnx
#
# Or install basic-pitch in a venv and copy from there:
#   pip install basic-pitch onnxruntime
#   python -c "import basic_pitch; print(basic_pitch.__path__)"
